{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04147","headline":"奉和幸新丰温泉宫应制 · 徐彦伯","name":"奉和幸新丰温泉宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"姬典歌时迈，虞篇记省方。\n何如黑帝月，玄览白云乡。\n翠仗萦船岸，明斾应萯阳。\n风摇花眊彩，雪艳宝戈芒。\n御陌开函次，离宫夹树行。\n桂枝笼騕褭，松叶覆堂皇。\n仙石含珠液，温池孕璧房。\n涌疑神瀵溢，澄若帝台浆。\n独沸流常热，潜蒸气转香。\n青坛环玉甃，红础铄金光。\n藻曜凝芳洁，葳蕤献淑祥。\n五龙归宝算，九鳸叶时康。\n同预华封老，中衢祝圣皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}